{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15538","headline":"晓过南宫闻太常清乐 · 陆贽","name":"晓过南宫闻太常清乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南宫闻古乐，拂曙听初惊。\n烟霭遥迷处，丝桐暗辨名。\n节随新律改，声带绪风轻。\n合雅将移俗，同和自感情。\n远音兼晓漏，余响过春城。\n九奏明初日，寥寥天地清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆贽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}